OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans who died by suicide
OL,4,Ahonoured at memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have gathered at the
OL,7,FNational Memorial Arboretum for the
OL,8,Fdedication of a permanent tribute to
OL,9,Fveterans and armed forces personnel who
OL,10,Fhave died by suicide.
OL,12,FThe Elysium Memorial, at the site in
OL,13,FElrewas, Staffordshire, is the first
OL,14,Fpermanent memorial of its kind to be
OL,15,Fbuilt in the UK.
OL,17,FMore than 1,300 military veterans and
OL,18,Fpersonnel have taken their lives in the
OL,19,Flast 30 years, with the memorial aiming
OL,20,Fto provide a place for contemplation
OL,21,Ffor those affected by the loss of a
OL,22,Ffriend or loved one.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
